# ── GitHub publishing (production / Vercel) ──────────────────
# Fine-grained personal access token with Contents: Read & Write
# on this repository only: https://github.com/settings/personal-access-tokens
# Leave GITHUB_TOKEN empty in local dev to save straight to local files.
GITHUB_TOKEN=
GITHUB_REPO=thvmax/ThvmaxArt-Portfolio
GITHUB_BRANCH=main
